      "file": "app/controllers/comms/tracking_controller.rb",
      "line": 38,
      "note": "Closed redirect, not an open one: the destination is EmailCampaignLink#url, written server-side at campaign freeze time from the author's compiled document (Comms::LinkExtractor), validated against \\Ahttps?://\\S+\\z, and looked up by id SCOPED to the recipient's own campaign. No URL from the request is ever redirected to — the request only carries the recipient token and a link id, and a link id from another campaign 404s. This is the click-tracking design (short URLs, author-stored destinations) chosen precisely to avoid an open ?u= redirect."
    }
